{{PageBanner|Mentoribanner.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the LINE Sticker brand known as '''Mentori''' (めんトリ) was held from April 2nd, 2018 to April 16th, 2018 for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] and March 14th, 2018 to March 28th, 2018 for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]. The collaboration includes an exclusive stage going on during the collab period.

==Event Information==
Lazy, cute, and ready to battle... it's {{Color|#FF0000|'''Mentori'''}}!<br>
Reluctantly joining the fight for a special crossover event with The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between March 14th (11:00) and March 28th, 2018 (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Mentori Collab Stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
It may be a drag, but its time to battle anyhow! Mentori is here (reluctantly) and ready to take on the Cats!<br>
Head to Stories of Legend/Event Stages and take on the Mentori's Masterplan stage! Clear all the stages to get a one-time reward of {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food'''}}!
Plus, clearing any stage will give you a chance to collect the limited unit [[Mentori (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Mentori'''}}]]! Later stages have a higher chance to receive Mentori as a reward!<br>
<small><small>※Use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to collect rewards!<br>
※If Collab Stages do not appear, ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login Each Day for another Stamp & Reward!'''}}<br>
Get a special Stamp each day you visit the Cat Base menu and earn more rewards!<br>
Don't forget to log in and pick up a Rare Ticket and tons of useful Items during this event!

©increws

